      "created_at": "2024-01-25T14:06:41.145Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi Everyone,</p>\n<p>I am trying to add the customer contact phone number on to the delivery note.</p>\n<p>By default the customer contact name and email address appear on the delivery note form but not the contact phone number. I am hoping there is a pretty simple fix for this if anyone could point me in the right direction?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
