      "id": 391603,
      "username": "Liam_Cav",
      "name": "Liam Cavanagh",
      "created_at": "2024-01-29T11:42:24.438Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ncp\">@NCP</a>,</p>\n<p>Thanks for the video, unfortunately that wouldn’t work for us as the phone number we are trying to fetch is the contact phone rather than the contact mobile.</p>\n<p>Screenshot of sales order customize form:<br>\n<a href=\"/uploads/short-url/dfsEZxWe7KAQO9VoCt8Gv4kVOvv.png\">Screenshot 2024-01-29 at 11.40.58|690x103</a></p>\n<p>By default this option does not appear on the delivery note so I am wondering if there is a way to grab that information with a custom field?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/7ba0ec/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 0,
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
