    {
      "id": 391604,
      "username": "NCP",
      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2024-01-29T11:46:45.995Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/liam_cav\">@Liam_Cav</a>,</p>\n<p>By default, the system will capture the contact’s mobile number, not the contact’s phone. If you want to include the contact’s phone number, you need to create a custom field for it and set up a code to make it work.</p>\n<p>Thank You!</p>",
